  "_comment": "issue 1554: the venue network facts the netcfg rule checks (scripts/netcfg_rules.py, run by scripts/netcfg-rules.sh) read. One entry per venue: how to dial its MikroTiks (read-only accounts only: SNV the key user camerabox of network#15, PP the read-only user snv of the PP admin, ROZHODNUTE 7167031660 on issue 1554), which verified read commands each device gets, and the venue's network rules (zbynekdrlik/mikrotik docs/snv-siet-pravidla.md, network#18). No credential is stored here: a key or password FILE path only. drift_ignore = what a device's own scripts change at runtime (router_snv: the pp-dns-switch scheduler every 30 s, the nlvpn route up/down scripts), left out of the export hash. See .claude/rules/netcfg-rules.md.",
